msgstr "There is no public photo yet. The app displays a placeholder."

msgid ""
"La imagen solo se publica con autorización. Los documentos privados del "
"expediente permanecen separados."
msgstr ""
"The image is only published with authorization. Private medical documents "
"remain separate."

msgid "Fotografía retirada del catálogo público."
msgstr "Photograph removed from the public catalog."

