msgstr "Logo (required)"

msgid "Tengo autorización para publicar el logo de esta organización."
msgstr "I have permission to publish this organization’s logo."

msgid "Confirmo que quiero retirar el logo del directorio público."
msgstr "I confirm I want to withdraw the logo from the public directory."

