msgstr "Edit public contact details and services"

msgid "Retirar logo"
msgstr "Withdraw logo"

msgid "Publicar o reemplazar logo"
msgstr "Publish or replace logo"

msgid ""
"El logo dejará de servirse en el directorio. Los datos de contacto tienen su"
" propia autorización de publicación."
msgstr ""
"The logo will no longer be served in the directory. Contact details have "
"their own publication authorization."

msgid ""
"JPEG, PNG o WebP · máximo 5 MB. Se guarda una copia WebP de hasta 512 px por"
" lado y 96 KB, sin metadatos. Conserva el formato rectangular o cuadrado del"
" logo. No se admiten SVG ni animaciones."
msgstr ""
"JPEG, PNG or WebP · maximum 5 MB. A WebP copy is stored at up to 512 px per "
"side and 96 KB, without metadata. Rectangular or square logo proportions are"
" preserved. SVG and animations are not accepted."

msgid "Publicar logo"
msgstr "Publish logo"

msgid ""
"La organización debe estar activa, verificada y registrada como fundación, "
"clínica o tienda."
msgstr ""
"The organization must be active, verified and registered as a foundation, "
"clinic or shop."

msgid "Logo de %(nombre)s"
msgstr "Logo of %(nombre)s"

msgid ""
"El logo registrado está oculto porque la organización no es pública "
"actualmente."
msgstr ""
"The stored logo is hidden because the organization is not currently public."

msgid "Todavía no hay un logo público para esta organización."
msgstr "There is no public logo for this organization yet."

msgid ""
"El logo se publica de forma independiente de los contactos. La plataforma "
"comprueba la autorización al publicar o retirar y la visibilidad de la "
"organización antes de servirlo. No puede retirar copias ya descargadas por "
"otras personas."
msgstr ""
"The logo is published independently of contact details. Authorization is "
"checked when publishing or withdrawing, and organization visibility is "
"checked before serving it. Copies already downloaded by other people cannot "
"be withdrawn."

msgid "Logo no disponible."
msgstr "Logo unavailable."

msgid ""
"Confirma que tienes autorización para publicar el logo de esta organización."
msgstr "Confirm you have permission to publish this organization’s logo."

